{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "e5f6a7b8-c9d0-1234-ef01-456789012345",
    "name": "Baby Go — Client Search",
    "description": "Catálogo público de clientes.\n\n**POST /v1/search?offset=0&limit=20** sin JWT.\nBody vacío lista productos y combos `active`.\nRespuesta `{ data, total, nextPage }`.\n`nextPage` es `{ offset, limit }` o `null`.\n`data[].kind`: `product` | `bundle`.\nCada ítem incluye `store.delivery` y `store.customerPickup` (timeRanges).\n\nFiltros opcionales:\n- `destination.country` = `store.country`. `city` busca en addressLine1/2.\n- `categories[].name` = id del taxonomy (`stroller`, `bike`, …). `types` matchea type/style/eceGroup/frameType/boxType/size. `accessories` matchea `attributes.accessories`.\n- `acquisition` / `devolution`: `delivery` | `customer_pickup` + `time` (minutos desde 00:00).\n- `rentalPeriod` valida fechas y elige el día del horario. No filtra stock.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000/api"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Search",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Catálogo (sin filtros)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/search?offset=0&limit=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "search"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "offset", "value": "0" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Público. Productos y combos active de todas las stores."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Por país y categoría",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"destination\": {\n    \"country\": \"NL\",\n    \"city\": \"Amsterdam\"\n  },\n  \"categories\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"stroller\",\n      \"accessories\": [\"rain-coat\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"bike\",\n      \"types\": [\"city\", \"kids\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"rentalPeriod\": {\n    \"start\": \"2026-10-01\",\n    \"end\": \"2026-10-07\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/search?offset=0&limit=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "search"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "offset", "value": "0" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "`city` matchea addressLine1/2. `types` en bike = attributes.type. No filtra disponibilidad de fechas."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Delivery + retiro con horario",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"destination\": {\n    \"country\": \"ES\"\n  },\n  \"rentalPeriod\": {\n    \"start\": \"2026-10-03T10:00:00.000Z\",\n    \"end\": \"2026-10-05T18:00:00.000Z\"\n  },\n  \"acquisition\": {\n    \"type\": \"delivery\",\n    \"address\": \"Calle Mayor 1, Madrid\",\n    \"time\": 600\n  },\n  \"devolution\": {\n    \"type\": \"customer_pickup\",\n    \"time\": 1080\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/search?offset=0&limit=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "search"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "offset", "value": "0" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "`time` = minutos desde 00:00 (600 = 10:00, 1080 = 18:00). Tiene que caer en un timeRange de la store ese día (o available24h). `address` no filtra distancia."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
